The Chapel of the Six is a chapel at the centre of [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence/Tali|Tali]], the town beneath the surface of the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]]. It is devoted to the six original heroes of [[Geography/Færrin|Færrin]], [[Divinity/Hierophant|Aurelia]] and her first companions, who ended the rule of the Warlords.

The followers of [[Divinity/Ashen Pact/Herald|Herald]] looted the chapel and sold what they took; a silver censer from it turned up in the Apothecarium in Upper Tali. The cult worked its summoning rites in the chapel, and it was here that [[People/Galzu|Galzu]]'s rite to bind a celestial into a mortal body was cut short, leaving an aether host behind. The [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence/Machine God|Machine God]] has since taken the chapel for its own.
